        "241. 画一长方体。用字母$A,B,C,D$表示上底面的顶点，用",
        "字母$M,S,K,P$表示下底面的顶点。用红铅笔作由点",
        "$A$出发的各条棱，用蓝铅笔作由点$C$出发的各条棱。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "242",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "242. 一块长方形土地长85米，宽47米。求这块土地的面积",
        "和周长。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "18. 含变量的式子"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题. 为了整修院子，先拉了5车砂子，后来又拉了$x$车。",
        "每车装3吨砂子。一共拉了多少吨砂子？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "往院里一共拉了$5+x$车砂子。由于每车砂子是3吨，所",
        "以一共拉了$3\\cdot(5+x)$吨砂子。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式子$3\\cdot(5+x)$含有变量$x$。这种式子叫做含变量的式子。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果在式子$3\\cdot(5+x)$里，用7代替$x$，就得到数式$3\\cdot(5+↵7)$，它的值是36。如果用9代替$x$，就得到数式$3\\cdot(5+9)$，它",
        "的值是42。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$x=7$，那么$3\\cdot(5+x)=36$；",
        "如果$x=9$，那么$3\\cdot(5+x)=42$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了解题，也可以列出另一式子：$3\\cdot5+3\\cdot x$。$x$取任意值",
        "时它与式子$3\\cdot(5+x)$的值都相同。写成："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当$x$为任意值时，$3\\cdot(5+x)=3\\cdot5+3\\cdot x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下表中列有这两个式子的一些值："
      ]
    },
